% composition-bridge: Listen for nested time: quick interlocking tones inside slower punctuation from larger gongs.
% composition-context: Gamelan names many distinct Indonesian ensemble traditions. This original pentatonic classroom piece compares layers and resonance; it is not a gamelan composition and should not be labelled Balinese music.
% composition-distance: Original notes and form; no named composition, tuning, kotekan pattern or gong cycle is copied.
